<p>Two habits make these counts reliable. First, never convert months to days by multiplying by 30: six calendar months from 17 November 2026 is 17 May 2027, which is 181 days, not 180 — the months in between decide, and a 30-day month is the exception, not the rule. Second, always read the weekday next to the landing date before you rely on it: a deadline that lands on a Saturday is a different problem from one that lands on a Tuesday, and this calculator shows the weekday precisely so you spot it before you commit.</p></section>
