<li><a href="/days-until-eid/">Days Until Eid</a> — Eid al-Fitr, the festival that ends Ramadan.</li>
<li><a href="/days-until-eid-al-adha/">Days Until Eid al-Adha</a> — the festival of sacrifice, about ten weeks after Eid al-Fitr.</li>
